{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 01 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">CNN 主干：从大规模分类到现代卷积</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CNN Backbones</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_002_resnet-title\">ResNet</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">显式 identity shortcut 与残差相加 y=x+F(x)。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Explicit identity shortcut connections combined with additive residual learning y = x + F(x).</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">2D 图像或 3D 体数据特征</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">2D image or 3D volumetric feature tensor</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">分类 logits、金字塔特征或下游编码表示</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Classification logits, multi-scale feature pyramid, or downstream encoded representations</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.2</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_cvpr_2016/html/He_Deep_Residual_Learning_CVPR_2016_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_002_resnet')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_002_resnet')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"ResNet original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/fb90d8738ce6fc9467fe.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.2</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_002_resnet', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_002_resnet\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_002_resnet')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_002_resnet', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_002_resnet\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">Stem</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stem</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">卷积与下采样建立第一层局部特征。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Initial convolutional stem and downsampling extract low-level local features.</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"卷积与下采样建立第一层局部特征。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Initial convolutional stem and downsampling extract low-level local features.\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"Stem\" data-node-name-en=\"Stem\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_002_resnet', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Stem</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">卷积与下采样建立第一层局部特征。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Initial convolutional stem and downsampling extract low-level local features.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"同时进入残差分支与恒等捷径。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Splits tensor simultaneously into the non-linear residual branch and the identity shortcut.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"块输入 x\" data-node-name-en=\"Block Input x\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_002_resnet', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">块输入 x</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Block Input x</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">同时进入残差分支与恒等捷径。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Splits tensor simultaneously into the non-linear residual branch and the identity shortcut.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"BasicBlock 用两层 3×3；Bottleneck 用 1×1–3×3–1×1。\" data-node-desc-en=\"BasicBlock stacks two 3×3 convolutions; Bottleneck uses a 1×1–3×3–1×1 channel compression-expansion design.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"F(x)\" data-node-name-en=\"F(x)\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_002_resnet', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>F(x)</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">BasicBlock 用两层 3×3；Bottleneck 用 1×1–3×3–1×1。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">BasicBlock stacks two 3×3 convolutions; Bottleneck uses a 1×1–3×3–1×1 channel compression-expansion design.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"维度不变时直接传递；变化时用 projection shortcut。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Passes features directly when dimensions match, or applies a 1×1 projection shortcut when stride/channels change.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Identity\" data-node-name-en=\"Identity\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_002_resnet', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Identity</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">维度不变时直接传递；变化时用 projection shortcut。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Passes features directly when dimensions match, or applies a 1×1 projection shortcut when stride/channels change.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"计算 y=x+F(x)，保留近似恒等映射与短梯度路径。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Computes y = x + F(x), preserving an unattenuated identity reference and short gradient highway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"残差相加\" data-node-name-en=\"Residual Addition\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_002_resnet', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">残差相加</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Residual Addition</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">计算 y=x+F(x)，保留近似恒等映射与短梯度路径。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Computes y = x + F(x), preserving an unattenuated identity reference and short gradient highway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"重复残差块并逐级降低分辨率、增加通道。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Stacks residual blocks across stages while progressively halving spatial resolution and doubling channels.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"分层 Stage\" data-node-name-en=\"Hierarchical Stages\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_002_resnet', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">分层 Stage</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Hierarchical Stages</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">重复残差块并逐级降低分辨率、增加通道。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Stacks residual blocks across stages while progressively halving spatial resolution and doubling channels.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把最终空间特征聚合为图像级向量。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Pools final spatial feature maps into a global image-level representation vector.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"全局平均池化\" data-node-name-en=\"Global Average Pooling\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_002_resnet', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">全局平均池化</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Global Average Pooling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把最终空间特征聚合为图像级向量。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Pools final spatial feature maps into a global image-level representation vector.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"连接分类头，或把多尺度 stage 特征交给检测/分割解码器。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Feeds the classification head or exports multi-scale stage features to detection/segmentation decoders.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"任务头\" data-node-name-en=\"Task Head\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_002_resnet', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">任务头</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Task Head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">连接分类头，或把多尺度 stage 特征交给检测/分割解码器。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Feeds the classification head or exports multi-scale stage features to detection/segmentation decoders.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"ResNet Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 残差分支与恒等捷径相加</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Additive Residual Branch with Identity Shortcut Mapping</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"ResNet：核心公式 · 残差分支与恒等捷径相加\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"2\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"9.151237pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.852406 -69.079189 78.605726 9.151237\" width=\"78.605726pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.803903 0V-.23821C4.645096-.287837 4.575619-.327539 4.506141-.436718L3.037178-2.699714L4.039646-3.950317C4.228229-4.178602 4.426737-4.287781 4.734425-4.337408V-4.575619H3.066955V-4.337408C3.156283-4.327483 3.235687-4.317558 3.265463-4.317558C3.493748-4.307632 3.573151-4.24808 3.573151-4.099198S3.473897-3.781585 3.195985-3.463972C3.136433-3.404419 2.987551-3.215836 2.83867-3.007402C2.779118-3.07688 2.739416-3.136433 2.70964-3.176134C2.392026-3.593002 2.133965-4.019795 2.133965-4.148825C2.133965-4.267931 2.272921-4.327483 2.60046-4.337408V-4.575619H.119105V-4.337408C.377166-4.297707 .436718-4.24808 .635227-3.950317L1.905681-1.995009C1.617843-1.627769 1.349857-1.30023 1.260528-1.161274C.704705-.426793 .506196-.258061 .138956-.23821V0H1.816352V-.23821C1.459037-.258061 1.320081-.327539 